From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:27:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: resolve MissAV VOD references from the effective
 playlist URL

The loopback extension reads the followed response but resolves media references against the URL before the redirect. In a controlled 1080p stream the browser played all eight fragments while the download lost exactly two relative references. Rebase only the successful finite media playlist being read for a MissAV download, on the source client's own response. Retain original quality and fail on upstream refusals. Report the missing time and a redacted error target.

The image downloader in Mihon and the independent Animeko player do not share this path.
